==========================================================================
2. CLUSTER LAW: max sign changes with m well-separated clusters = 2m-3
==========================================================================
    m   best sizes found      max sign changes    predicted 2m-3
    1   None                         0                 0         OK
    2   [3, 2]                       1                 1         OK
    3   [4, 5, 2]                    3                 3         OK
    4   [5, 4, 5, 3]                 5                 5         OK
    5   [5, 2, 3, 4, 4]              7                 7         OK
    6   [2, 3, 4, 4, 3, 4]           9                 9         OK
  mechanism: c_k ~ -Delta^2(sorted log-root step function); a step function
  with m-1 kinks has 2(m-1) alternating second-difference spikes, and the
  boundary trims exactly one, leaving 2m-3.
  VERDICT 2: CLUSTER LAW CONFIRMED AND ATTAINED

